      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i'm a 35yo guy working an office job and i want to start lifting weights seriously. can u give me a basic 4 week linear progression program? basically just focusing on squat, bench, and deadlift to get a baseline of strength. nothing too crazy, just something structured.",
