      "content": "Starting with foundational compound lifts is a great plan for building strength! For this basic four-week linear progression, aim to do 3 sets of 5 repetitions for squat, bench press, and deadlift. Each week, try to increase the weight on your main lifts by a small, manageable amount (e.g., 2.5 or 5 lbs). Focus intensely on good form before adding any significant weight to ensure safety and effectiveness.",
