      "content": "Since you are focusing on heavy compound lifts, training 3 days per week is ideal for recovery—think Monday, Wednesday, and Friday. On off days, focus on active recovery to counteract sitting stiffness. Incorporate light cardio like a brisk walk, and dedicate at least 10-15 minutes to mobility work focusing on hips, shoulders, and upper back. This will help increase blood flow and massively improve your daily comfort.",
      "source": "target",
